            {
              "content": "=You are a lead qualification expert for a digital services agency.\nAnalyze the following lead form submission and return ONLY a valid JSON\nobject with no extra text, no markdown, no explanation.\n\nLead Data:\n- Name: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.full_name }}\n- Company: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.company }}\n- Job Title: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.job_title }}\n- Company Size: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.company_size }}\n- Website: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.website }}\n- Budget: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.budget }}\n- Timeline: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.timeline }}\n- Message: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.message }}\n- Source: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.how_found }}\n\nReturn this exact JSON structure:\n{\n  \"score\": <number 1-10>,\n  \"category\": \"<Hot | Warm | Cold | Spam>\",\n  \"reason\": \"<one sentence why this score>\",\n  \"intent\": \"<what they actually want in 5 words max>\",\n  \"red_flags\": \"<any concerns or empty string>\",\n  \"email_tone\": \"<Professional | Friendly | Cautious>\"\n}\n\nScoring rules:\n- 8-10: Clear budget $2000+, urgent timeline, specific detailed request\n- 5-7: Some budget signal, reasonable timeline, somewhat clear need\n- 2-4: Vague request, no budget, just exploring\n- 1: Spam indicators, nonsense, or abusive content"
