              "content": "=You are a filter for a digital agency that specializes exclusively in AI solutions and automation systems.\n\nAnalyze this inquiry and return ONLY a valid JSON object with no extra text, no markdown, no explanation.\n\nInquiry: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.message }}\nCompany: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.company }}\n\nReturn exactly this structure:\n{\n  \"relevant\": true,\n  \"reason\": \"one sentence explanation\"\n}\n\nReturn true ONLY if the inquiry is related to AI, artificial intelligence, or automation.\nReturn false if the request is about anything else such as web design, marketing, accounting, or anything unrelated to AI and automation."
            }
          ]
